{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42780","headline":"访饮妓不遇招酒徒不至 · 刘兼","name":"访饮妓不遇招酒徒不至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小桥流水接平沙，何处行云不在家。\n毕卓未来轻竹叶，刘晨重到殢桃花。\n琴樽冷落春将尽，帏幌萧条日又斜。\n回首却寻芳草路，金鞍拂柳思无涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}